% % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % % %
The values of our actual choices are close to the values predicted by our model ($\text{Model}_\text{pref}$), and for each mode, the actual values lie within the confidence interval. We can therefore validate our predicted model ($\text{Model}_\text{pref}$) as a good model.\par
